  <section class="section-lg">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>The problem we lived</h2>
      <p>Running a payroll bureau shouldn’t mean juggling fifteen spreadsheets, waking at 3am wondering if you missed an RTI submission, or scrambling for a status update when a client calls. Yet that’s the daily reality for thousands of UK payroll professionals working with tools that were never built for how a bureau actually operates.</p>
      <p>ThePayBureau started because our founder, Minhaz Moosa, runs a payroll bureau and lived those problems every single day. Payroll software runs the calculations — but nothing pulled together the <em>practice around it</em>: every client, every HMRC deadline, every checklist and pension declaration, in one place.</p>

      <h2>What we’re building</h2>
      <p>ThePayBureau is a payroll CRM, powered by AI. It tracks every RTI, FPS and EPS deadline automatically, keeps a checklist for every payroll cycle, manages every client and pension declaration, and gives you Penny — an AI assistant that answers questions across your whole book in plain English.</p>
      <p>It’s free forever for individual consultants, and grows with you: from a solo consultant, to a multi-person bureau, to an enterprise operation — one account, no migrations, no new systems.</p>

      <h2>Our commitment</h2>
      <p>We’re building this with, and for, the payroll community. The roadmap evolves with customer and community feedback — your voice shapes what we build next. And because it’s our own clients’ data on the platform too, security and reliability aren’t features we bolt on — they’re built into every layer.</p>

      <h2>The company</h2>
      <p>ThePayBureau is operated by <strong>Intelligent Payroll Limited T/A The Pay Bureau</strong>, registered in England and Wales. Get in touch any time at <a href="mailto:support@thepaybureau.com">support@thepaybureau.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

